description	"ISB Officer

An intel officer who specializes in gathering info for their team and ambushing their targets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Applies Tracking
- Stun-Baton (2)
-- Applies Tracking/Knockback/Cripple/Blind
- ISB Modified RK-3 Pistol
-- Applies Tracking
-- Mag Reload
-- 20%+ Damage/20%- RoF/10%+ Velocity

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Rally
- Know your Enemy (Sense Immunity)
- Awareness (Anti MT 2)
- Tapped Comms (Ally Stat Viewer)
- Tactical Acumen (+15% Melee Movement Speed)
- Security Specialist (+40% Hack Speed)
- ISB Comm-Link (Tracking Beacon)
- Resilience (Healing 1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Grapple-Hook (1) ^3[CS4 Melee]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS4]
- Tracking-Darts (12) ^3[CS2]"
